Q: GroupBy on multiple properties with complex type A: <p>nowadays, best would be to not create complex types using classes, but using Records: Records implement Equals() and GetHashCode() based on property values</p>
<p>so you can just create</p>
<pre><code>public record AddressGroup  
{
    public int SiteRefNum { get; set;} 
    public string SiteRefName { get; set;}
    public string Address { get; set;}
}
</code></pre>
<p>and than do the GroupBy using</p>
<pre><code>var aggregated = sitesWithLive
    .GroupBy(s =&gt; new AddressGroup { SiteRefNum = s.SiteRefNum, SiteRefName = s.SiteRefName, Address = s.Address})
    .Select(g =&gt;
        new Site
        {
            SiteRefNum = g.Key.SiteRefNum,
            SiteRefName = g.Key.SiteRefName,
            Address = g.Key.Address,
            ContractLive = g.Max(x =&gt; x.ContractLive)
        });
</code></pre>

Q: How do I embed a YouTube video in HTML5 with no errors? A: <p>Add div tag like this one:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
  &lt;iframe width=&quot;560&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/9ZIgQFKaK4Y&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>Then you can add css later. See in this link: <a href="https://www.w3schools.com/howto/howto_css_responsive_iframes.asp" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.w3schools.com/howto/howto_css_responsive_iframes.asp</a></p>

Q: Margin or Padding Bootstrap Menu A: <pre><code>&lt;nav class="navbar navbar-inverse navbar-fixed-top" role="navigation"&gt;
        &lt;div class="container"&gt;
            &lt;!-- Brand and toggle get grouped for better mobile display --&gt;
            &lt;div class="navbar-header"&gt;
                &lt;button type="button" class="navbar-toggle" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#bs-example-navbar-collapse-1"&gt;
                    &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Toggle navigation&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;span class="icon-bar"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;span class="icon-bar"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;span class="icon-bar"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;/button&gt;
                &lt;a class="navbar-brand" href="#"&gt;
                    &lt;img src="http://placehold.it/150x50&amp;text=Logo" alt=""&gt;
                &lt;/a&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;!-- Collect the nav links, forms, and other content for toggling --&gt;
            &lt;div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="bs-example-navbar-collapse-1"&gt;
                &lt;ul class="nav navbar-nav"&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        &lt;a href="#"&gt;About&lt;/a&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
